  m_text: '<b>Local Multiplayer</b> is where two players play on the same screen
    and fight together.


    Player 1 (left side):


    Move: <color=#FFCC00>A
    / D</color>

    Jump: <color=#FFCC00>W</color>

    Attack (horizontal): <color=#FFCC00>F</color>

    Attack
    (vertical): <color=#FFCC00>G</color>

    Roll: <color=#FFCC00>S</color> (while
    moving)


    If you want more info on volume


    Check Out the <b>Volume Tab!</b>'
